# Internal files that should not be uploaded to the deployment.
#
# Next.js only serves /public and built routes, so these would not be
# publicly fetchable by URL the way they were on the flat static 11_GovSite
# deploy. Excluding them anyway: they name project IDs, open legal gates,
# decision numbers, and the full poll curation reasoning, and none of it is
# needed to build or run the app.

# Internal documentation
README.md
NEXT-SESSION-NOTES.md
DEPLOYMENT_HANDOFF.md
TRENDING_POLL_PIPELINE.md
components/WIRING_NOTES.md

# The original artifact, kept for cross-reference only. Contains the
# DemoVotingAdapter and window.storage prototype code that must never ship.
components/artifact-source-reference.jsx

# Database DDL and internal measurement queries -- run by hand in the
# Supabase SQL editor, never needed by the running app.
supabase/

# Local tooling
.vercel
.env*
